## Introduction
 A modern, interactive restaurant website built with vanilla Javascript, CSS, and webpack. Users can browse Home, Menu, and Contact Sections with smooth navigation.

## Features
- Single Page Apllication: Seamless navigation without page reloads.
- Modular Codebase: Each section managed in its own module.
- Responsive Design: Clean, mobile-friendly UI.
- Webpack Building: Efficient asset management and workflow.

## Screenshots
![Home](Images/Home.png)


## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript


## Installation
1. Clone the repository:
    ```bash
    git clone https://github.com/Princessglory/Restaurant-web.git
    ```
2. Navigate to the project directory:
    ```bash
    cd Restaurant-web
    ```
3. Open `index.html` in your browser or use a local server.

## Usage
- Browse the menu and gallery.
- Make reservations using the online form.
- Contact the restaurant via the provided details.

